Bronius: When I saw you in Castelia,
I did not care about your existence.{VAR BE01}
Here in the Chargestone Cave,
Ghetsis tested your ability...{VAR BE01}
Once more, we will test you to learn
what it is you are.{VAR BE01}
Team Plasma, come out!{VAR BE01}

Team Plasma: Because of you,
I'm now ex-Team Plasma.{VAR BE01}
Being an ex doesn't sound cool, does it?
How are you going to make it up to me?{VAR BE01}

Team Plasma: An ex-Team Plasma member
becomes an ordinary Pokémon Trainer...{VAR BE00}
This was that moment.{VAR BE01}

Bronius: The Pokémon of our Team Plasma
are also fighting for their Trainers.{VAR BE01}
It was so obvious that I overlooked it...
Thank you for reminding me of that.{VAR BE01}
Here, I'd like you to take this.{VAR BE01}

Bronius: Pokémon do their best for their
Trainers even when they are injured.{VAR BE01}
I wonder whether my lord N understands
what that means?{VAR BE01}

Looker: On the topic of Team Plasma...{VAR BE01}
I am an officer of the
International Police,{VAR BE00}
so you would be wise{VAR BE00}
to share all you know.{VAR BE01}

Bronius: Those who left Team Plasma and
are behaving with respect and{VAR BE00}
understanding toward Pokémon...{VAR BE01}
Them, please forgive!
However, those who won't interact with{VAR BE00}
Pokémon in a kind and honest way...{VAR BE00}
Even I will never forgive them!{VAR BE01}

Looker: Truly, I thank you!{VAR BE01}
Now, Ghetsis notwithstanding,
there yet remains but {VAR 0200 0000} of the{VAR BE00}
Seven Sages still at large.{VAR BE01}
Their innermost thoughts,
their uttermost hopes...{VAR BE00}
These I must and shall discover!{VAR BE00}
Once more, a brief farewell!{VAR BE01}

Looker: Thank you!{VAR BE01}
{VAR 0100 0000}, there is something
of which we must speak.{VAR BE01}
A report has been received. By me.
Far from here, a sighting occurred of a{VAR BE00}
person like N and--a dragon Pokémon.{VAR BE01}
I must instantly go to confirm the
complete confirmation of this report.{VAR BE00}
I will see you again, and soon!{VAR BE01}
